tivity.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_cdbcccf5a7334b6a4f8c271d\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2cb1946568c5490c5a3ee4bdb9c2a51d2485f16543f002ab190bad74ea8b5fa1\", \"id\": \"e29\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_f9cdc877ee94b3e239474695\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [40, 41], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_c34cc028aa58bdc71b596e60\", \"prem_557380a823b71cb9aa5730a8\"], \"source_alias\": \"s31\", \"id\": \"src_cdbcccf5a7334b6a4f8c271d\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2cb1946568c5490c5a3ee4bdb9c2a51d2485f16543f002ab190bad74ea8b5fa1\", \"start\": 105, \"end\": 430, \"exact_quote\": \"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \", \"raw_text_hash\": \"97a13cbc5bfeff771ff3594db7911e39465543994e7a3a76cae81fe0c4c4b6fd\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_music_preferences\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"97a13cbc5bfeff771ff3594db7911e39465543994e7a3a76cae81fe0c4c4b6fd\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [40, 41], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_557380a823b71cb9aa5730a8\", \"prem_c34cc028aa58bdc71b596e60\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 105, \"end\": 430, \"exact_quote\": \"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \"}, {\"node_id\": \"user_music_preferences\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"contradiction\", \"claim\": \"The user prefers activities that are not too time-consuming.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user explicitly states the podcast was too time-consuming, implying a preference against such activities.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_cd555041daee6ba7db621dbf\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:bae454f4fe57dc35dda1965cc93898027809778211952df12ba1ac4564da3cc2\", \"id\": \"e53\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_74b39f1c4b6a36011947cb1a\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [26, 27], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_91fce95fe9d6fcf70b17b440\", \"prem_44473032b32a028a02872129\"], \"source_alias\": \"s51\", \"id\": \"src_cd555041daee6ba7db621dbf\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:bae454f4fe57dc35dda1965cc93898027809778211952df12ba1ac4564da3cc2\", \"start\": 105, \"end\": 361, \"exact_quote\": \"User: In 2018, I started a podcast about music trends, but it was way too time-consuming. While the idea was initially exhilarating, the responsibility of researching, recording, and editing each episode started to pile up, consuming much of my free time. \", \"raw_text_hash\": \"59e934cd51942e9a0af8b51f426d92d133b3683b371995da338dc4406729ddd7\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_music_preferences\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"59e934cd51942e9a0af8b51f426d92d133b3683b371995da338dc4406729ddd7\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [26, 27], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_44473032b32a028a02872129\", \"prem_91fce95fe9d6fcf70b17b440\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 105, \"end\": 361, \"exact_quote\": \"User: In 2018, I started a podcast about music trends, but it was way too time-consuming. While the idea was initially exhilarating, the responsibility of researching, recording, and editing each episode started to pile up, consuming much of my free time. \"}, {\"node_id\": \"user_music_preferences\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"contradiction\", \"claim\": \"The user did not enjoy watching a music documentary as it failed to evoke the same deep connection as composing their own pieces.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user states that watching a music documentary felt like something was missing and didn't engage them in the way they had hoped.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_848dcb0e5c55f34d70033595\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2cb1946568c5490c5a3ee4bdb9c2a51d2485f16543f002ab190bad74ea8b5fa1\", \"id\": \"e38\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_3cdb7daafe8335b16a5639d1\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [40, 41], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_a0c1e399a5a548b49b046cb8\", \"prem_60eca48f797101e48ab30125\"], \"source_alias\": \"s35\", \"id\": \"src_848dcb0e5c55f34d70033595\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2cb1946568c5490c5a3ee4bdb9c2a51d2485f16543f002ab190bad74ea8b5fa1\", \"start\": 1339, \"end\": 1686, \"exact_quote\": \"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\", \"raw_text_hash\": \"97a13cbc5bfeff771ff3594db7911e39465543994e7a3a76cae81fe0c4c4b6fd\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_music_preferences\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"97a13cbc5bfeff771ff3594db7911e39465543994e7a3a76cae81fe0c4c4b6fd\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [40, 41], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_60eca48f797101e48ab30125\", \"prem_a0c1e399a5a548b49b046cb8\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 1339, \"end\": 1686, \"exact_quote\": \"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep c